Subject: [PATCH] reject unsupported subjects in the JavaScript authority

Return a not-supported error for subjects that cannot be converted to JavaScript instead of aborting the daemon. Add a regression test covering authorization, administrator identities, and subsequent requests with a supported subject.

Fixes: https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit/issues/699

